    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>This class abstracts handling of a set of version specifiers.

It can be passed a single specifier (``&gt;=3.0``), a comma-separated list of
specifiers (``&gt;=3.0,!=3.1``), or no specifier at all.
</verbatim> </para>
